## Market benchmark

/Users/ivanmarjanovic/Documents/basebol/src/odds.py:56: RuntimeWarning: divide by zero encountered in divide
  return np.where(o > 0, 100.0 / (o + 100.0), np.abs(o) / (np.abs(o) + 100.0))
Matched a price for 6,919 of 7,289 games (94.9%). Mean closing margin 0.0415.

| forecaster | Brier | vs base | t |
|---|---:|---:|---:|
| this model | 0.2447 | +0.00418 | 3.07 |
| market opening line | 0.2388 | +0.01008 | 8.62 |
| market closing line | 0.2341 | +0.01478 | 11.88 |

The closing line beats a constant by 0.01478. This model captures 28% of that.

## Decision layer

Filled at the best opening price across books, marked against the consensus close. 4,874 bets on 75% of games, hit rate 0.4830.

